    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a cell-based hydrology drainage basin network on a 2D heightmap grid. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class implements hydrological flow network computations (receivers, outlets, main channels, upstream traversals) on a regular grid represented by a 2D <ref refid="classhmap_1_1Array" kindref="compound">Array</ref>. </para>
